/**
 * @defgroup lexleo_vm_cr_api lexleo_vm CR API
 * @ingroup lexleo_vm_api
 *
 * @brief Composition Root API for constructing and destroying LexLeo VM
 * instances.
 *
 * @details
 * This API is intended exclusively for Composition Root code responsible for
 * assembling LexLeo VM instances.
 *
 * VM construction is split into two steps:
 * - `lexleo_vm_create()` creates the VM handle from a configuration value and
 *   a borrowed runtime environment.
 * - `lexleo_vm_complete_default_init()` completes the handle by creating the
 *   owned runtime resources required by the default VM configuration.
 *
 * The borrowed runtime environment stores dependencies provided by the
 * caller. The owned runtime resources created during default initialization
 * become part of the VM handle lifetime and are released by
 * `lexleo_vm_destroy()`.
 */
